<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Irene Vinuesa — Finance · Markets · Code · Data</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #F5F1E6;
    --bg-soft: #ECE5D3;
    --ink: #211D17;
    --ink-soft: #4E483D;
    --muted: #8C8471;
    --rule: #DBD2BC;
    --gold: #A38F5C;
    --gold-soft: #C6B283;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
      --bg: #15130F;
      --bg-soft: #1D1A15;
      --ink: #ECE6D8;
      --ink-soft: #C7C0AE;
      --muted: #948C77;
      --rule: #322C22;
      --gold: #C9AF77;
      --gold-soft: #E1CC93;
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] {
    --bg: #15130F;
    --bg-soft: #1D1A15;
    --ink: #ECE6D8;
    --ink-soft: #C7C0AE;
    --muted: #948C77;
    --rule: #322C22;
    --gold: #C9AF77;
    --gold-soft: #E1CC93;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: "Inter", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  .serif { font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif; }

  .container {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }

  a { color: inherit; }

  .label {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  hr.rule {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  nav.topnav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 20;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 90%, transparent);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .nav-inner {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 22px 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .logo {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .navlinks {
    display: flex;
    gap: 30px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .navlinks a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    padding-bottom: 3px;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .navlinks a:hover { color: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold); }

  .navlinks .idx {
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-right: 6px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .nav-right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .ring-dot {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ring-dot::after {
    content: "";
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold);
  }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero {
    padding: 88px 0 96px;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .kicker {
    font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin: 0 0 26px;
  }

  h1.name {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.4vw, 3.6rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.06;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 26px;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 48ch;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }

  .lede.cities {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    margin: 0 0 42px;
  }

  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 44px;
  }

  .circle-btn {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    transition: background 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
  }

  .circle-btn:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--bg);
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }

  .cta-link {
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .cta-link .sub {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .cta-secondary {
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cta-secondary:hover { color: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold); }

  .stats-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 56px;
    padding-top: 30px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .stat .num {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .stat .cap {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* ---------- HERO EMBLEM ---------- */
  .emblem-wrap {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 420px;
  }

  .emblem-caption {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    max-width: 130px;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .emblem-quote {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 6px;
    left: 0;
    max-width: 220px;
  }

  .emblem-quote p {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .emblem-quote .qline {
    width: 34px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--gold);
  }

  .emblem-svg circle.dashed {
    stroke: var(--gold-soft);
  }

  .emblem-svg .tick {
    stroke: var(--rule);
  }

  .emblem-svg .star {
    stroke: var(--gold);
  }

  .emblem-svg text {
    fill: var(--gold);
    font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
  }

  .emblem-svg .iv {
    fill: var(--ink);
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
  }

  .spin-slow {
    animation: spin 90s linear infinite;
    transform-origin: 200px 200px;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .spin-slow { animation: none; }
  }

  @keyframes spin {
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  /* ---------- NUMBERED SECTIONS ---------- */
  .num-section {
    padding: 80px 0 56px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .num-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 110px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 8px 32px;
  }

  .num-mark {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 6.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--gold-soft);
    align-self: start;
  }

  .num-content {
    max-width: 640px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .num-caption {
    position: absolute;
    top: 6px;
    right: 0;
    max-width: 150px;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: right;
  }

  h2.headline {
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.6vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.14;
    margin: 10px 0 18px;
  }

  .num-content p.body {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: 0 0 30px;
  }

  /* ---------- ROW LISTS ---------- */
  .row-list {
    margin-top: 48px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .row-item {
    padding: 26px 28px 0;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--rule);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .row-item:first-child { border-left: none; padding-left: 0; }

  .row-year {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .row-title-line {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .row-title {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .row-arrow {
    color: var(--muted);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .row-item:hover .row-arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  .row-sub {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ---------- ABOUT ---------- */
  .interest-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px 10px;
    margin: 0 0 44px;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .interest-list li {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
  }

  .reading-list {
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .reading-item {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .reading-item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }

  .reading-title {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
  }

  .reading-author {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* ---------- CONTACT / FOOTER ---------- */
  footer.contact {
    padding: 72px 0 60px;
  }

  .contact-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 30px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 34px 0 60px;
  }

  .contact-links a {
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    padding-bottom: 3px;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .contact-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold); }

  .foot-bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 26px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  /* ---------- RESPONSIVE ---------- */
  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .emblem-wrap { order: -1; min-height: 300px; }
    .emblem-caption, .emblem-quote { display: none; }
    .num-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .num-mark { font-size: 4rem; }
    .num-caption { position: static; text-align: left; max-width: none; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .row-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .row-item { border-left: none !important; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding: 22px 0 0 !important; }
    .row-item:first-child { border-top: none; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .container, .nav-inner { padding-left: 22px; padding-right: 22px; }
    .stats-row { gap: 32px; }
  }

  :focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--gold);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="topnav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <div class="logo">IV</div>
    <div class="navlinks">
      <a href="#home"><span class="idx">01</span>Home</a>
      <a href="#experience"><span class="idx">02</span>Experience</a>
      <a href="#projects"><span class="idx">03</span>Projects</a>
      <a href="#about"><span class="idx">04</span>About</a>
      <a href="#contact"><span class="idx">05</span>Contact</a>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-right">
      <span>Madrid, Spain</span>
      <span class="ring-dot"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="container">

  <header class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">Finance · Markets · Code · Data</p>
        <h1 class="name serif">Irene Vinuesa</h1>
        <p class="lede">I'm a final-year dual-degree student — BSc in Business Analytics and BBA, with exchanges at Wharton and SMU — interested in the intersection of investing, markets and technology.</p>
        <p class="lede cities">I've lived in London, New York, Singapore, Madrid and Philadelphia.</p>

        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="circle-btn" href="#experience" aria-label="Explore my work">→</a>
          <a class="cta-link" href="#experience">Explore my work</a>
          <a class="cta-secondary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/irene-vinuesa-balmaseda/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
        </div>

        <div class="stats-row">
          <div class="stat">
            <div class="num serif">05</div>
            <div class="cap">Cities<br>lived in</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <div class="num serif">04</div>
            <div class="cap">Main<br>interests</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <div class="num serif">∞</div>
            <div class="cap">Ideas<br>to explore</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="emblem-wrap">
        <p class="emblem-caption">Classical rigor,<br>modern markets</p>

        <svg class="emblem-svg" width="360" height="360" viewBox="0 0 400 400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <g class="spin-slow">
            <circle class="dashed" cx="200" cy="200" r="160" fill="none" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 6"/>
            <path id="motto-circle" d="M200,60 A140,140 0 1,1 199.9,60" fill="none"/>
            <text font-size="11" letter-spacing="3">
              <textPath href="#motto-circle" startOffset="2%">VIA · CURIOSITAS · PROGRESSUS · VIA · CURIOSITAS · PROGRESSUS ·</textPath>
            </text>
          </g>
          <g class="tick" stroke-width="1">
            <line x1="200" y1="18" x2="200" y2="34"/>
            <line x1="200" y1="366" x2="200" y2="382"/>
            <line x1="18" y1="200" x2="34" y2="200"/>
            <line x1="366" y1="200" x2="382" y2="200"/>
          </g>
          <g class="star" fill="none" stroke-width="1">
            <path d="M200,140 L208,192 L260,200 L208,208 L200,260 L192,208 L140,200 L192,192 Z"/>
            <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="6" fill="var(--gold)" stroke="none"/>
          </g>
          <text class="iv" x="200" y="325" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="2">EST. FINAL YEAR</text>
        </svg>

        <div class="emblem-quote">
          <p class="serif">"I'd rather understand the world than try to predict it."</p>
          <div class="qline"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <hr class="rule">

  <!-- EXPERIENCE -->
  <section class="num-section" id="experience">
    <div class="num-grid">
      <div class="num-mark">01</div>
      <div class="num-content">
        <p class="num-caption">Different desks.<br>One curiosity.</p>
        <p class="label">Experience</p>
        <h2 class="headline serif">Learning from the best.</h2>
        <p class="body">Exposure to different markets, banks and teams has shaped how I think about finance, risk and decision-making.</p>
        <div class="cta-row" style="margin-bottom:0;">
          <a class="circle-btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/irene-vinuesa-balmaseda/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="View full experience">→</a>
          <a class="cta-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/irene-vinuesa-balmaseda/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View full experience</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row-list">
      <a class="row-item" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/irene-vinuesa-balmaseda/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="row-year">2026</div>
        <div class="row-title-line">
          <span class="row-title">Goldman Sachs, London</span>
          <span class="row-arrow">→</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row-sub">TMT Investment Banking</div>
      </a>
      <a class="row-item" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/irene-vinuesa-balmaseda/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="row-year">2025</div>
        <div class="row-title-line">
          <span class="row-title">Management Solutions, NYC</span>
          <span class="row-arrow">→</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row-sub">Financial &amp; Data Summer Analyst</div>
      </a>
      <a class="row-item" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/irene-vinuesa-balmaseda/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="row-year">2024</div>
        <div class="row-title-line">
          <span class="row-title">Evercore</span>
          <span class="row-arrow">→</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row-sub">Investment Banking Generalist</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule">

  <!-- PROJECTS -->
  <section class="num-section" id="projects">
    <div class="num-grid">
      <div class="num-mark">02</div>
      <div class="num-content">
        <p class="num-caption">One curiosity.<br>Many tools.</p>
        <p class="label">Projects</p>
        <h2 class="headline serif">Turning ideas into evidence.</h2>
        <p class="body">Independent research and models exploring how markets price risk, growth and uncertainty.</p>
        <div class="cta-row" style="margin-bottom:0;">
          <a class="circle-btn" href="#projects-list" aria-label="View all projects">→</a>
          <a class="cta-link" href="#projects-list">View all projects</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row-list" id="projects-list">
      <a class="row-item" href="#">
        <div class="row-year">01</div>
        <div class="row-title-line">
          <span class="row-title">Dutch Bros</span>
          <span class="row-arrow">→</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row-sub">Fundamental Equity Research</div>
      </a>
      <a class="row-item" href="#">
        <div class="row-year">02</div>
        <div class="row-title-line">
          <span class="row-title">Quant Portfolio Lab</span>
          <span class="row-arrow">→</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row-sub">Python · Portfolio Construction</div>
      </a>
      <a class="row-item" href="#">
        <div class="row-year">03</div>
        <div class="row-title-line">
          <span class="row-title">Volatility Surface</span>
          <span class="row-arrow">→</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row-sub">Options · Python</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule">

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section class="num-section" id="about">
    <div class="num-grid">
      <div class="num-mark">03</div>
      <div class="num-content" style="max-width:720px;">
        <p class="label">About</p>
        <h2 class="headline serif">Curious by design.</h2>
        <p class="body">A dual degree, three exchange semesters and five cities have all pointed the same direction: understanding how capital, data and people move together.</p>

        <ul class="interest-list">
          <li>Equity Research</li>
          <li>Quantitative Finance</li>
          <li>Venture Capital</li>
          <li>Emerging Markets</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="label" style="margin-bottom:16px;">Recommended readings</p>
        <div class="reading-list">
          <div class="reading-item">
            <span class="reading-title serif">The Intelligent Investor</span>
            <span class="reading-author">Benjamin Graham</span>
          </div>
          <div class="reading-item">
            <span class="reading-title serif">Poor Charlie's Almanack</span>
            <span class="reading-author">Charles T. Munger</span>
          </div>
          <div class="reading-item">
            <span class="reading-title serif">Fooled by Randomness</span>
            <span class="reading-author">Nassim N. Taleb</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule">

  <!-- CONTACT -->
  <footer class="contact" id="contact">
    <div class="num-grid">
      <div class="num-mark">04</div>
      <div class="num-content">
        <p class="label">Contact</p>
        <h2 class="headline serif">Let's talk markets.</h2>
        <p class="body">Always happy to talk investing, data or the next idea — reach out on LinkedIn or by email.</p>

